{
  "id": "DAN.8",
  "number": "8",
  "bookId": "DAN",
  "reference": "Danieli 8",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DAN 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Libisulo liaDanieli, lieLimiiku nerule Ikhole",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumuyika kwakhataru kwoburuchi bwaBeleshazari, libisulo liandoleshela isie Danieli, olunyuma lwa eshio eshiaranjilila okhundoleshela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ndahenga libisulo; ne olwa ndahenga, ndali muSusa, litookho, elili mulukongo lwaElamu; nihenga libisulo, nindi hamwalo kwaUlai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ninjinguula tsimoni nihenga, ne limiiku eliali netsinzika tsibili ndielo, nilisinjiile imbeli womwalo. Tsinzika tsana tsiachinguukha muno; ne lulala lwachinguukha hekulu okhushila olundi nalwo olwahekulu nilwo olwamaliilikha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindola limiiku tsana nililuuma mumbo, khandi enanotsi, khandi enasautsi; ne yabulaho isolo yosi eyakhanyala okhusinjila imbeli walio; khandi yabulaho owakhanyala okhuhonia eshili mumukhono kwalio; ne liakholanga shinga olwa liachama, niliikhulumamia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa ndali niyililisinjiakhwo, lola, ikhole njieyo, niyirula mumbo niyibira khushialo shiosi, oburaseenakhwo khwiloba ta; ikhole eyo niyiba nolwika lulala olulolekha muno, hakari wetsinzika tsiayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayo niyitsa khwimiiku tsana eliali netsinzika tsibili, elia ndali ninduutsi nilisinjiile imbeli womwalo, niyiliirushila mubululu bwobunyali bwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninjilola niyula ahambi khwimiiku, khandi mbu yali niyililuliile muno, niyilikhupa, niyifunaka tsinzika tsialio tsiombi tsibili; nalio limiiku liabula amaani okhwema imbeli wayo; ne yalikhupa hasi, niyilitubanjila; kata yabulaho owakhalihonia limiiku mumukhono kwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho ikhole tsana niyiikhulumamia muno; nebutswa olwa yali niyili netsingufu muno, olwika lwayo olukhongo lwafinikha, mana tsinzika tsindi tsine etsilolekha muno nutsirombookha mushilenje shialwo, nitsichooma enamiyeka chine echielikulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne okhurula mululala khutsio, olwika olutiiti nilurombookha, nilukhongoha muno, niluchooma enasautsi, khandi enabukwe, khandi enashialo eshing'oonefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nilukhongoha, kata okhuula khumahe akelikulu; nilusukuna etsindi etsiomumahe tsana netsinyininyini hasi khwiloba, nilubitubanjila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nilwikhulumamia kata okhuula khuMukhulundu wamahe tsana; omusango kwakhatsotso nikumuyinibwakhwo, habunduwe ahatakatifu nihalikululwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niluheebwa lihe, halala nomusango tsana kwakhatsotso, khulwa obukhayi; obwatoto nibusukunwa hasi, olwika tsana nilukhola akalwo, nako nikakaasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nimbulila omutakatifu undi naboola; omutakatifu undi khandi nasunjila oyo owali naboolile mbu Lilabeetsangaho okhuula liina, libisulo lino eliomusango kwakhatsotso, nobukhayi obuleeranga obusasishi, nahabundu ahatakatifu okhuhaanwa okhutubanjilwa hasi webilenje, halala nende lihe liene?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nakalusia mbu Okhuula khubise biomutsuli nende mungoloobe, ebikhumila bibili nebikhumi bitaru; mana habundu ahatakatifu halakalusibwa habwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa isie Danieli ndali ninduutsi libisulo tsana, ndakhaaba okhumanya eshisina; mana lola, oundi nasinjiile imbeli wanje, nalolekha shinga omundu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbulila omwoyo kwomundu hakari wetsinguku tsiaUlai, nikulanjisia mbu Gaburieli, manyia omundu uno eshisina shielibisulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho niyasitila ahambi; ne olwa yoola ario, ndaria, nindikhupa hasi mafumamaj naye niyasunjila mbu Iwe omwana womundu, hulila eshisina; mbu libisulo lino nelieshise shiobumaliilishi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yali nashisunjilanga, tsindoolo tsinyinji nitsimbila, ningonile endio mafumama; ne yandiilakhwo, niyasinjisia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyasunjila mbu Lola, nekhumanyie akalabaho khubumaliilishi bwobusinyishi; okhuba kachooma khunduukho yobumaliilishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Limiiku tsana elia oluutsi, elibeele nende tsinzika tsibili, etsio nitsio abaruchi baMedia naPerisia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayo ikhole yamaswa amanji niyo omuruchi webuYunani; ne olwika olukhongo tsana oluli hakari wetsimoni tsiayo niIwo omuruchi owambeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khukolwenolwo olwafinikha, olwa etsindi tsine tsiarombookha mushilenje shialwo, mbu oburuchi bune bularombookha okhurula mwihangalie; ne harali obunyalibwe ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mundaalo etsihelelesia muburuchi bwabwe, shinga khumwitsulu kwobukhayi bwabwe, omuruchi undi alabuukha, owakhanya mumoni, oumanyanga akeminehe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obunyalibwe bulaba obwamaani, nebutswa shibulaba khulwa obunyali bubwe omwene ta; aloonooninjia muno; ne obukholibwe bulakaasa; aloonoonia abalulu nende abandu babatakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwa obuchesichesibwe alatsitsachisia akobukaatii akali mumukhonokwe; aleekhulumamia mumwoyokwe, niyoonoonia abanji abakaala mbu bamenyanga shisale. Kata alabuukha okhuyinga Omukhulundu wabakhulundu; nebutswa alaarasibwa harali omukhono kwomundu ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Libisulo liebise biomungoloobe nomutsuli eliakhaboolwa neliatoto; ne obohe libisulo tsana; shichila nelietsindaalo etsishili okhwitsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasi Danieli nikhaywa, nimba omulwale tsindaalokhwo. Mana nimbuukha ninziililila khumilimo chiomuruchi; libisulo elo niling'ang'aasia, kata shindatiila khushisina shialio ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.8.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
